------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fuzzwork Enterprises (SDE conversion)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SDE builder (cmd/sde, sde/build) downloads the SQLite conversion of Fenris
Creations' Static Data Export published by Fuzzwork Enterprises
(https://www.fuzzwork.co.uk/) and reshapes it into the schema this project uses. Thanks
to Steve Ronuken for maintaining the conversion. The conversion is fetched at build time
and never bundled.

